  Title: Wandering Peddler's Wager
  Subtitle: UNKNOWN ENCOUNTER
  StoryText: A chuckling traveler shuffles three wooden cups on a stump. 'Care for
    a quick trade, friend? Gold, power, or a mystery trinket!'
  Illustration: {fileID: -1372926879, guid: f084f991d3468664190c4758f6203e33, type: 3}
  Choices:
  - Label: Buy the Mystery Box
    OutcomePreview: "[-60g \u2022 Gain Random Relic]"
    ResultStory: '''Pleasure doing business!'' Inside the wrapped parcel shines an
      authentic relic.'
    RequiredMinGold: 60
    RequiredMinHealth: 0
    GoldDelta: -60
    HealthDelta: 0
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: 0
    GrantRandomRelic: 1
    GrantRandomCard: 0
  - Label: Trade a Story for Coin
    OutcomePreview: '[Gain 70 Gold]'
    ResultStory: The peddler laughs heartily at your tale of the Spire and tosses
      you a plump coin purse.
    RequiredMinGold: 0
    RequiredMinHealth: 0
    GoldDelta: 70
    HealthDelta: 0
    MaxHealthDelta: 0
    StressDelta: 0
    GrantRandomRelic: 0
    GrantRandomCard: 0
  - Label: Decline Politely
